+// v8xx SWG bit 16 STAND-OFF (b2395, spec_swg_1113; callers read SWG_ON(16) first): a lone ranged tank on a pack (wolf-only, 12+) hits only
+// from the free tile with the fewest living wolves in reach (GR:209: reach 3, no chase), a wolf in my range 3, out of a seen foe's
+// one-turn reach (foe_next_turn_reach); ties: the nearest. Every such tile above SWG_K wolves: no hit (step out of reach if in it).
+// False: not this case or low fuel (live's turn goes on). Unseen members count as alive. Grid and tile are cached (swg_grid, fuel trim).
+static __attribute__((noinline)) bool swg_standoff_turn(int gi, bool& acted)
+{
+	const GroupI& g = M.groups[static_cast<std::size_t>(gi)];
